<abstract>
<gco:CharacterString>The Ukrainian asylum applications data was retrieved from the UNUNHCR refugee statistics API and spans from 2013 to 2023. The focus is European countries as destinations. The applications are categorized as follows:N - New applicationsR - Repeat applicationsA - Appeal applicationsNR - New and repeat applications: where the data was provided togetherFA - First and appeal applicationsJ - Judiciary: applications are at the Judicial level.</gco:CharacterString>
</abstract>
<purpose>
<gco:CharacterString>The dataset contains asylum applications figures of Ukrainians in Europe from 2013 to 2023. The data was retrieved from the UNHCR refugee statistics API.</gco:CharacterString>
</purpose>
